<title>POLAND: BIG plans no 1996 payout.</title>
<headline>BIG plans no 1996 payout.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Bank Inicjatyw Gospodarczych SA (BIG) plans no dividend payout for 1996, the bank said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>BIG said it the management board would ask the March 25 shareholders meeting to earmark its 1996 net profit of 55.2 million zlotys for reserve capital and for the bank's risk fund.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
